error[E0543]: a subclass of 'Session' would inherit this hook and receive a 'Session'
 --> $DIR/new-object.nra:3:12
  |
3 |     | get: new Session();
  |            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^ a new 'Session' for every subclass's references
  |
  = note: a hook's result must be nil or an object of exactly the class of the reference it handles
  = help: mark the class #Final, or return 'instance', 'value', 'nil' or an existing object of the same class

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0543`.
